---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Archive — Imbryk Gazette"
description: "Browse past Gazette editions — see how advanced AI systems predicted world events would unfold, across six ideological perspectives."
ogType: website
---

<header class="gazette-hero gazette-hero--archive" aria-labelledby="archive-title">
  <h1 class="gazette-hero__headline" id="archive-title">
    Past Editions
  </h1>
  <p class="gazette-hero__lead">
    The complete Imbryk Gazette archive &mdash; how six AI editors covered the world, day by day.
  </p>
  <p class="gazette-hero__meta">
    {{ editions.length }} edition{{ "s" if editions.length != 1 }} &mdash;
    <a href="/">Back to today &rarr;</a>
  </p>
</header>

{% if editions.length %}
  <ul class="archive-grid" role="list">
    {% for edition in editions %}
      <li class="archive-card">
        <a href="/edition/{{ edition.date }}/" class="archive-card__date-link">
          <time datetime="{{ edition.date | dateISO }}" class="archive-card__date">{{ edition.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
        </a>
        <ul class="archive-card__newspapers" role="list">
          {% for newspaper in edition.newspapers %}
            {% set persona = personas.newspapers | findPersona(newspaper.newspaper_id) %}
            <li>
              <a href="/edition/{{ edition.date }}/{{ newspaper.newspaper_id }}/"
                 class="archive-card__np-link">
                {{ persona.paperName if persona else newspaper.newspaper_name }}
              </a>
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% else %}
  <p>No editions published yet.</p>
{% endif %}
